{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219180/extras/eaadd2196471d4fe69722e4bcf2d76c6.poster.avif?t=1761199662\" width=960 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219180/extras/eaadd2196471d4fe69722e4bcf2d76c6.webm?t=1761199662\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219180/extras/eaadd2196471d4fe69722e4bcf2d76c6.mp4?t=1761199662\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a vast, immersive dark fantasy world brimming with secrets as you explore The Unknown Lands in Cursemark, an action-exploration roguelite with ARPG elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219180/extras/f8bcd06147121f6c154e338fac3acea3.poster.avif?t=1761199662\" width=960 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219180/extras/f8bcd06147121f6c154e338fac3acea3.webm?t=1761199662\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219180/extras/f8bcd06147121f6c154e338fac3acea3.mp4?t=1761199662\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock tons of powerful skills as you venture forth, and alter their effects with an immense variety of runes, which can be slotted into your spells to create a wide array of unique builds - make a fireball shoot ice spears, make a gas cloud summon lightning strikes from the sky - you define your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219180/extras/83093c855a6082dc3d5f09096c8187f2.avif?t=1761199662\" width=960 height=480 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Unknown Lands are vast, with many secret passages, hidden relics, and strange sights. Each run will unravel the world more and more, giving you a chance to make new discoveries, unlock shortcuts, and have a unique experience each time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your mettle through dynamic combat as you experience a beautiful, yet harsh land filled with a wide variety of powerful enemies, unique bosses, and many other challenges.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3219180?t=1761199662","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219180/4b0985d6ef5a3a8c01828b9b93ed914fe96e8b1b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761199662","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219180/dcc05836d5fe112d056c94dd0368d92b1c1c4b5f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761199662","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219180/dcc05836d5fe112d056c94dd0368d92b1c1c4b5f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761199662","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3853080,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219180/extras/eaadd2196471d4fe69722e4bcf2d76c6.poster.avif?t=1761199662\" width=960 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/321