nes, and secrets in this haunted kingdom beyond the edge of the world.","steam_appid":3219180,"support_info":{"email":"caseysclyde@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Korean, German, French, Spanish - Latin America","type":"game","website":null}